{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Joshua likes to play with numbers and patterns. Joshua's favorite number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because it is the units digit of his birth year, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/4944bcd1e5f1c6890c49160993314481c933217d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1996$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. \nPart of the reason Joshua likes the number 6 so much is that the powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> all have the same units digit as they grow from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/353f68d49261d6db166aede2d54212312e0b17a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6aa43386a932605b83d60a4d97a9386b0679d05.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}6^1&amp;=6,\\\\6^2&amp;=36,\\\\6^3&amp;=216,\\\\6^4&amp;=1296,\\\\6^5&amp;=7776,\\\\6^6&amp;=46656,\\\\\\vdots\\end{align*}\" width=\"89\" height=\"193\" />\nHowever, not all units digits remain constant when exponentiated in this way. One day Joshua asks Michael if there are \nsimple patterns for the units digits when each one-digit integer is exponentiated in the manner above. Michael responds, \n\"You tell me!\" Joshua gives a disappointed look, but then Michael suggests that Joshua play around with some numbers \nand see what he can discover. \"See if you can find the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d40d26190f8fcdc21bd1b26d14c4c605c7148e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008^{2008}$\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />,\" Michael challenges. After a little while, \nJoshua finds an answer which Michael confirms is correct. What is Joshua's correct answer (the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d40d26190f8fcdc21bd1b26d14c4c605c7148e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008^{2008}$\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />)? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The statement is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/2/5f25262cdd328c2346ce2911bea50eea74851af7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008^{2008}\\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />. We can simplify this to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9beca9d86385b2b68ba7fdbfb480f4563fe976c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2008} \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"21\" />. We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8de90b6cf0493914db76648f53bb6260ac9c527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^1 \\equiv 8 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e8f14a32a0258e52a50f4179869574d3af4fb1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^2 \\equiv 4 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a89e3386e3430036d1d7418c88241f5b3912e1cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^3 \\equiv 2 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f79287238b661b346e2c2ef20b95a2535a1e90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^4 \\equiv 6 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/e/81e16e195ed2d0d02d7936eabdf1a21b02bd2a18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^5 \\equiv 8 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />. We see that this pattern will repeat every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms. Thus, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f79287238b661b346e2c2ef20b95a2535a1e90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^4 \\equiv 6 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" /> and the pattern repeats every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1ed9531ac9b672178cec74e62aadc87ceae541a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2008}\\equiv \\boxed{6} \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The statement, like above, is the same as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9beca9d86385b2b68ba7fdbfb480f4563fe976c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2008} \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"21\" />. Set the expression equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />. Then, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b6952b90576c3fbc92e395027f082fd68fdf86b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2008} \\equiv i \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22c9e30446aeccfee8f5d72072911a4088c4b8a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2007} \\cdot 4 \\equiv \\frac{i}{2} \\pmod {5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"39\" />. It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6baea653a2460f36ebb4bf6f95f8a6a01b3ab5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{4} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"21\" /> through Euler's Totient Theorem. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/1885155c698e89fcce2393cef87d7b3664cc4f8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2007} \\equiv 8^{2004} \\cdot 8^3 \\pmod{5} \\equiv 512 \\pmod{5} \\equiv 2 \\pmod 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"21\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/2/e82b683b03cf45eebe502a8ddb41c729a6a6b19a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2007} \\cdot 4 \\equiv 3 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"21\" />. Then, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/1996c999f3345c00d7cf5da50fc5337ebcd48ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\pmod 5 = \\frac{i}{2} \\pmod 5 \\equiv 8^{2007} \\cdot 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"276\" height=\"39\" />. We multiply by 2 to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f5978bdb0a3caece0ac29c431f181626b4447a84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6} \\pmod {10} \\equiv 8^{2008}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"164\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.